 ## Schema compilation and caching

-- A static `ToolDefinition` has its `inputSchema` compiled once at `register` time, so a schema that is not valid JSON Schema throws synchronously from `register` with an error message naming the offending tool ([validated by: throws at register time naming the tool when a static inputSchema cannot be compiled](../../src/orchestration/tools/registry.acceptance.test.ts#L94), [validated by: compiles static inputSchema at register time, allowing formats and naming invalid tools](../../src/orchestration/tools/registry.test.ts#L221)).
